#: core/pro/admin/Help.php:63
msgid "This panel shows all currently scheduled jobs with the WordPress CRON."
msgstr ""

#: core/pro/admin/Help.php:65
msgid "When the CRON is registered by any plugin, SweepPress will attempt to determine the Source plugin for the job. This is used in the Source column to help you identify each job."
msgstr ""

#: core/pro/admin/Help.php:66
msgid "If the job is scheduled before SweepPress is installed, the plugin can't detect the source plugin."
msgstr ""

#: core/pro/admin/Help.php:67
msgid "Option 'Delete' will effectively remove the scheduled job from the CRON."
