msgid "This panel shows the database structure with all the database that current WordPress instance sees."
msgstr ""

#: core/pro/admin/Help.php:79
msgid "Only tables registered with the WordPress database prefix or accessible via WordPress database object are listed. Tables that belong to WordPress Core all have the WordPress Logo Icon in the column with the table name."
msgstr ""

#: core/pro/admin/Help.php:80
msgid "Displayed information is coming from the Database server, and in some cases, the data may not be completely accurate, due to the way some of the database operations are performed and how the statistics is updated and refreshed."
